[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="CanvasLayer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer/CharactersPage/Narrative"]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 1132.0
offset_top = -289.0
offset_right = 2255.0
offset_bottom = 171.0
theme = ExtResource("9_d77ms")
text = "The Crown Lies Empty

The old king is dead, and the throne of Tiny Swords sits cold.

You are Bramble, a humble pawn with calloused hands and a borrowed axe. No one knows your name. No one will, not yet.

Fell the oaks. Break the stone. Hunt the flocks across the valley. Every blade you forge and every hardship you endure will carry you one step higher.

Prove your steel with a bowstring and a steady eye, and warriors will fall in behind you.

Rise, Bramble. The kingdom needs a king."

